msgid "Folder where per-show recordings are written.  Each show flagged as \"Record this show\" produces a single file of the on-air output, named <YYYY-MM-DD HH-MM-SS> - <show-name> under a per-day subfolder, in the format and bitrate chosen below.  Leave the folder empty to disable recording."
